        {
          "id": "lock-door",
          "label": "LOCK ROOM",
          "text": "**Todd**: Alice! ALICE! Daddy's comin'! You need to be taught a lesson.\n\n**Kara**: Have to find something...\n\n**Todd**: ALICE! OPEN THIS FUCKIN' DOOR!\n You're gonna get a helluva thrashin', Alice! Open this door right now!",
